\u2022 Increased sebum production induced by androgens on the pilosebaceous unit \n\u2022 Abnormal follicular keratinisation, with formation of keratin plugs \n\u2022 Overgrowth of Cutibacterium acnes (formerly known as Propionibacterium acnes) \n\u2022 Inflammation", "type": "Document"}}